And you might need another SCSI controller. The MX5 variant (as opposed 
to the GL variant) does not have an onboard SCSI controller. And the NT
variants will most likely have an Adaptec PCI SCSI controller which cannot
be booted from using the SRM console.

Or you can use an IDE disk of course.

